init(from:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment\/init(from:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"init(from:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Decoder","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/init(from:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"}],"title":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The client-supplied half of an OPAQUE enrolment, as it appears inside registration \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change-password \/ reset-completion \/ bootstrap request bodies. There is no standalone"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register\/finish"},{"type":"text","text":" endpoint, deliberately. A record can only be created at a moment when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plaintext password legitimately exists on the client, and every one of those moments is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already an endpoint that takes a password. A free-standing finish would be an endpoint whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only job is to attach a credential to an account, which is a thing worth not having. Kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separate from ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CreateOpaqueCredential"},{"type":"text","text":"] because the tenant, the user and the credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier are all decided by the server — a client that could name them could enrol a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record against somebody else’s account."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}